window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>One night together. That's it. Except letting go isn't an option anymore.</p> <p>New day. New town. New temptation.</p> <p>I prowl the wastelands of this post apocalyptic world solo, a lone wolf.</p> <p>When I find him, a scrappy young man with fire in his eyes, my hunger stirs.</p> <p>That defiant gaze challenges me.</p> <p>I thought I'd wander alone, but claiming this fierce boy?</p> <p>I wasn't prepared for that.</p> <p>But when two wild souls collide, you surrender.</p> <p>You take.</p> <p>And you don't let go.</p> <p>So that's what I do, regardless of our age gap.</p> <p>I make him mine...</p> <p>In every way.</p> <p>Grab this steamy M/M dark short story romance set in a post apocalyptic world, featuring an alpha hero, an age-gap romance, and plenty of V-card fun and praise.</p>"; 
